error[8-0018]: left-hand side of assignment is immutable
   ┌─ sum_shape_methods.fe:25:5
   │
25 │     p.first().unwrap() = 3
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ immutable assignment

error[8-0070]: an access is not a value
   ┌─ sum_shape_methods.fe:15:5
   │
15 │     v.get(0).unwrap_or(default: 5)
   │     ^^^^^^^^ this access is used as a value
   │
   = bind an access with `let`, pass it to a `mut` or view parameter, or yield it from a projection

error[8-0119]: a read access needs a `ref` binding
   ┌─ sum_shape_methods.fe:20:9
   │
20 │     let inner = v.get(0).unwrap()
   │         ^^^^^ this binds a read access of `MemVec<u64>`, which is not `Copy`
   │
   = mark the binding `ref` to hold the access, as `let x = ref …`, `(i, ref x)` or `for ref x in …`
